  "contentval": "000PGzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/1566",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>자동차전문가 되어 있는 아이를<br>과학전문가(?)로 만들기 위해<br><br>이제 9살된 아들과 서울 혜화동에 있는<br>국립 어린이 과학관을 다녀왔어요<br><br><br><br><br><br>3년전쯤 리모델링후 재개관한 곳이랍니다<br><br>재개관했을때<br>학교 아이들 데리고 가려고<br>문의 전화를 했을때<br>중학생들은 재미없어할거라는 말에 <br>진행을 멈추었었죠<br><br>이번에 첫 방문했는데<br>중학생들은 다소 시시해 할 거 같긴 합니다<br>물론 중학생들도 호기심을 가지고<br>신기해 할 만한 것도 있긴 합니다<br>초등학교 저학년까지는 아주 재미있어 할거 같아요<br><br>인터넷으로 입장&amp;천체영상 예약하고 갔어요<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/01f704259d7d279bb4d7b19f5b44f6feef04dee8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/01f704259d7d279bb4d7b19f5b44f6feef04dee8\" data-origin-width=\"2250\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c66263e265057134662d0d65f500a6990b36521\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c66263e265057134662d0d65f500a6990b36521\" data-origin-width=\"1836\" data-origin-height=\"3264\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>1층 입구에 있는 태양계 <br>요즘은 ~계를 많이 만나네요<br><br><br>2층부터 관람을 했는데<br>2층 첫부분에 골드버그라고 해야하나요<br>어마어마한 골드버그가 있어요<br>한쪽 벽과 천장을 다 장악한..</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bcee9df599c4da1b53645a4604f5980e72641bdf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bcee9df599c4da1b53645a4604f5980e72641bdf\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/96b66cf8a7423c93f980448989cf7ea05131a600\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/96b66cf8a7423c93f980448989cf7ea05131a600\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>그리고 도르래 <br>고정, 움직 도르래</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e623df4e0fa0b35a9b2f7cde225c129c54b896fb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e623df4e0fa0b35a9b2f7cde225c129c54b896fb\" data-origin-width=\"1836\" data-origin-height=\"3264\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a301e6a8d21bfc6b400744e77af85c50aa513523\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a301e6a8d21bfc6b400744e77af85c50aa513523\" data-origin-width=\"1836\" data-origin-height=\"3264\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>계산을 해봅니다<br>뒤에 추가 있어서 줄이 5개가 작용되어<br>1/4보다 더 적은 힘으로 들어 올립니다 (좋아요)<br>뒤에 추가 있어서 더 많은 일을 합니다 (안좋아요)<br>추는 줄을 놓았을때 갑자기 떨어져 다치지 않게 하기 위함인듯 보이네요<br><br><br>공기대포<br>앞에 일회용컵을 넘어트립니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da7402b7b47a3b3476bb8412429d832097c0cb41\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/da7402b7b47a3b3476bb8412429d832097c0cb41\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>바람으로 슛은<br>제가 영재학급에서 하는 건데 있네요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3a6327c07a67104f900ed5a1c7408f9375c9e080\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3a6327c07a67104f900ed5a1c7408f9375c9e080\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"2250\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>전향력 확인하는 장치인데<br>회전판 크기가 작아서 확인하기 어려워요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dbfb513b2d65cb7d74f68eb90f9b0cb0bba064b2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dbfb513b2d65cb7d74f68eb90f9b0cb0bba064b2\" data-origin-width=\"2250\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>2분 일하고 5분 쉬는 티라노<br>부럽다~~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/683475b66267a5741ccf711eed166f02af9743d8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/683475b66267a5741ccf711eed166f02af9743d8\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>빛의 삼원색을<br>그림자로 확인하기<br>사람들이 다 분신을 만듭니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6fac8040a8ea55e7e96fc28c834724f08983c22e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6fac8040a8ea55e7e96fc28c834724f08983c22e\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>요새 아이가 드럼에 빠져서<br>드럼 강좌 신청해 놓아서<br>여기서 멤돌더군요<br>한쪽에 전자드럼도 있어요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/48c733eabad315b392e6c2a1ee1ce7d087716156\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/48c733eabad315b392e6c2a1ee1ce7d087716156\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>싸이클로이드 - 레일이 하나 이상해서 싸이클로이드를 만들 수 없었다는 ㅠ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/90a21de1cfb64e86f83199212357cdfeb9757ace\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/90a21de1cfb64e86f83199212357cdfeb9757ace\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>이거는 뭔지??</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/77dcf61d3375086a277d9d55259ac258c5780738\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/77dcf61d3375086a277d9d55259ac258c5780738\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ae972a0346d14b3d5c86bcef3712a979a762664\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ae972a0346d14b3d5c86bcef3712a979a762664\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>핀볼게임처럼 될 줄 알았는데<br>나무 막대의 마찰력이 약하여ㅠ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/62be17a0eeff35e6068323386fa4827e93cf01f9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/62be17a0eeff35e6068323386fa4827e93cf01f9\" data-origin-width=\"1836\" data-origin-height=\"3264\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br><br><br>불장난, 물장난이 제일 재미있죠<br>여기서 거의 모든 시간을 보냈다는<br>남자아이들의 집합소</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6ae3bd76a19a40041305bafdb49186a02d8235f8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6ae3bd76a19a40041305bafdb49186a02d8235f8\" data-origin-width=\"1836\" data-origin-height=\"3264\"><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>천체투영관<br>어린이과학관이라 보노보노 애니메이션으로<br>별이야기를 봅니다<br>별자리와 현재 별의 위치를 보여주는<br>다른 천문대나 과학관과는 다릅니다<br>초등학교 저학년들이 좋아할.....</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f2b3ab7d7b43585a560eb53bd425f3ce365b2b52\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f2b3ab7d7b43585a560eb53bd425f3ce365b2b52\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>구슬 미로<br>다이어트가 됩니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1460d02fd8cdcd257bf3bb780e3acf1913eddb1e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1460d02fd8cdcd257bf3bb780e3acf1913eddb1e\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>재과만에서 처음 봤던..<br>무슨 그림이 될까 신기한....</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/202b465bcfd9ca96b54a7bf7ac203d6a46f9765d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/202b465bcfd9ca96b54a7bf7ac203d6a46f9765d\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"2250\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br><br>우사인볼트가 정말 정말 빠르다는 것은 느낀</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f4bd7d32802f02f0385671932fdd748262336e75\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f4bd7d32802f02f0385671932fdd748262336e75\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>요즘 전시장에 많이 나오는<br>관람객이 무엇인가 디자인 만들어<br>전시화시키는......</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7365fa769e3381023116a9b2129e43ea3546711f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7365fa769e3381023116a9b2129e43ea3546711f\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br><br>진동 맥놀이를 2차원으로 표현하는<br>2차원 진자라고 또는 리사주라고 할까요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5a2bb6137a2722a50eb437048905aa775873cd5c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5a2bb6137a2722a50eb437048905aa775873cd5c\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cec781bcf321b699db5d1f77012629f2e3181f0b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cec781bcf321b699db5d1f77012629f2e3181f0b\" data-origin-width=\"3264\" data-origin-height=\"1836\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>주차는 힘들어<br>대중교통을 이용했어요<br><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}